{"id":"vod_zy360_65087","vodId":"65087","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"在魔王城说晚安","name_cn":"在魔王城说晚安","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241003-1/f1673eeccfe3bfbf66274010e37b42a7.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个人类与魔族共存的世界，但是世界的支配权还是掌握在人类的受众。一天，魔王抓走并囚禁了人类公主栖夜莉丝（水濑祈配音），并且向人类发出了勒索信，要求人类用世界的支配权来换回公主的自由。为了拯救公主，勇者拂晓（下野纮配音）踏上了充满了危机的旅途。然而，被囚禁的日子实在是太过于无聊了，古灵精怪又闲不住的栖夜莉丝决定在魔王城里找点乐子。无论是恶魔教会的法师雷欧纳多（石川界人配音）还是世代侍奉魔王的忠犬哈士奇（小林亲弘配音），甚至连威风凛凛的魔王（松冈祯丞配音）本人，都被公主的恶作剧给耍得团团转。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-03 19:34:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/JQp1T1ci/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/kzO0Hh0Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/uuTg3xsL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/O3u91uuy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/vnWirBtg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/IApZzbGc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/pNXP2gns/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/25RVYgpU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/qBPI8l4k/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/lKTaBq43/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/jpiox1D8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241003/aeIx7ZbB/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:39.834Z"}